#: src/postulo/templates/cotton/identifier_schemes.html
msgid "Taking a scheme out deletes no identifier. The ones recorded under it are kept and shown under its key, with no link, and are what they were again once the scheme is back. Changing a scheme's pattern refuses none either: an identifier that no longer fits is kept as it was, marked where it is shown, and checked when it is next changed."
